<title>USA: Bluegreen Corp names John Chiste CFO.</title>
<headline>Bluegreen Corp names John Chiste CFO.</headline>
<dateline>BOCA RATON, Fla. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bluegreen Corp said on Monday that it named John Chiste its chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Chiste replaces Alan Murray, who left the company in February to pursue other business interests.</p>
<p>Chiste most recently served as chief financial officer for Compscript Inc, a Boca Raton provider of pharmacy services, Bluegreen said in a news release.</p>
<p>Bluegreen is a residential land developer.</p>
</text>
